DEPOSITION OF: the-castle.trial.
ENACT: ../canon/statutes-of-trigonometry.trial.

OFF THE RECORD: a scripted speedrun, deposed frame by frame. K. walks
OFF THE RECORD: the corridor north (w), looks right and left and
OFF THE RECORD: straightens up again (d, a, a, d), marches to the
OFF THE RECORD: Castle wall (w), is refused by it twice (the last two
OFF THE RECORD: strides move him nowhere), and gives up (q). Sixteen
OFF THE RECORD: proclamations: fifteen frames and one resignation.

SERVE: w.
